  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The posters each contain artwork in green and purple and 6 or 7 poems relating to a different word: voluntad, esencia, firmamento, surco, convícción, and incertidumbre. The sheets are intended to be hung on a wall as posters and can be paired up in various arrangements.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The three additional smaller sheets contain the "prólogo" (2 sheets) and biographies of the poet and artist (1 sheet).</subfield>
